  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_XE_ALPHA_WREN_WHO",
    "dynamic_line": "Wren Calloway.  Harlan pack, from over the ridge.  We ran with your people on the big moons, remember?  Voss hit us first.  He killed everyone and kept me.  Said werewolf blood was the finest vintage there was.  He drank from me every night for a month.",
    "responses": [ { "text": "I'm sorry.", "topic": "TALK_XE_ALPHA_WREN" } ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_XE_ALPHA_WREN_SIRE",
    "dynamic_line": "His maker.  He called her the Countess, like she was royalty.  He wrote to her, sent her blood from the cellar in bottles.  She's old, a lot older than him, and he was scared of her.  If he's dead, she'll know.  And she'll come looking for whoever did it.",
    "responses": [ { "text": "Let her come.", "topic": "TALK_XE_ALPHA_WREN" } ]
  },
  {
    "type": "talk_topic",
    "id": "TALK_XE_ALPHA_WREN_JOIN",
    "dynamic_line": "Two wolves is a pack.  Lead the way, Alpha.",
    "responses": [ { "text": "Let's go.", "topic": "TALK_DONE" } ]
  }
